--------------------------------------- rule

POST /cache/set/{{ any >> $$key }}

----- action

cache.set($$key, req.body.all())

----- response: 200

--------------------------------------- rule

GET /cache/value/{{ cache.contains(value) >> $$key }}

----- response

~ body
{{ cache.get($$key) }}

--------------------------------------- rule

GET /cache/value/{{ !cache.contains(value) }}

----- response

~ code
404

--------------------------------------- rule

POST /cache/remove/{{ any >> $$key }}

----- action

cache.remove($$key)

----- response: 200
